---
// About / intro. `home-section` is a responsive hook (mobile side-padding only).
---

<section id="about" class="home-section" style="position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1;background:#efece6;color:#0b0b0c;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:96px 30px 70px;">
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.14);padding-bottom:14px;margin-bottom:60px;">
    <span>(About — 01)</span><span>Independent design &amp; development</span><span>2026 ©</span>
  </div>
  <div class="g-split" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr .9fr;gap:48px;align-items:end;">
    <div data-reveal>
      <h2 style="margin:0;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(58px,11vw,170px);line-height:.84;letter-spacing:-.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">I<br />BUILD<br />WEBSITES.</h2>
      <p style="margin:30px 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:500;max-width:480px;">I'm <strong>Divyansh Sood</strong> — an independent web designer &amp; developer based in Himachal Pradesh, India, working with clients worldwide. Every site is custom-coded (no page-builder templates) and starts from how your customers actually make decisions — then design, engineering and SEO follow, all under one roof. Most projects go live in about 3–4 weeks.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:22px;font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.04em;">
        <span style="border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.22);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;">React</span>
        <span style="border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.22);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;">Next.js</span>
        <span style="border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.22);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;">Astro</span>
        <span style="border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.22);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;">Angular</span>
        <span style="border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.22);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;">Tailwind</span>
        <span style="border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.22);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;">Supabase</span>
        <span style="border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.22);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;">Razorpay</span>
        <span style="border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.22);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;">Headless CMS</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal>
      <p style="margin:0 0 26px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:500;max-width:380px;">Websites moving forward feel <span style="opacity:.62;">precise, natural, and impossible to overthink.</span> Every pixel earns its place — built for speed, clarity, and conversion.</p>
      <div class="imgfill" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/10;border-radius:6px;background-image:url('https://ik.imagekit.io/dn2zdxiu3/Portfolioprojectimages/AiWebsitegenerator/AiWebsitegenerator-2.webp');"></div>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:16px;font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.55;">
        <span>↳ See the work</span><span>Showreel ●</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
